s compiled from sources within Treasury departmental offices and bureaus, as well as various other Federal program agencies. Readers can contact the publication staff to inquire about any of the published information.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [415, 1014, 1217, 1056], \"page_id\": 2}], \"content\": \"The publication staff can also be reached by electronic mail.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [519, 1098, 1098, 1138], \"page_id\": 2}], \"content\": \"treasury.bulletin@fiscal.treasury.gov\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [204, 1162, 1428, 1245], \"page_id\": 2}], \"content\": \"Internet service subscribers can access the Treasury Bulletin in Microsoft Word or PDF format through the Bureau of Fiscal Service\\u2019s home page.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [625, 1287, 984, 1329], \"page_id\": 2}], \"content\": \"www.fiscal.treasury.gov\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [557, 189, 1071, 262], \"page_id\": 3}], \"content\": \"Table of Contents\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [146, 321, 552, 361], \"page_id\": 3}], \"content\": \"FINANCIAL OPERATIONS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [138, 389, 1454, 1626], \"page_id\": 3}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><td><b>PROFILE OF THE ECONOMY</b></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Analysis\\u2014Summary of Economic Indicators</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td><b>FEDERAL FISCAL OPERATIONS</b></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Introduction\\u2014Federal Fiscal Operations</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td>Analysis\\u2014Budget Results and Financing of the U.S. Government and Third-Quarter Receipts by Source</td><td>13</td></tr><tr><td>FFO-A\\u2014Chart: Monthly Receipts and Outlays</td><td>15</td></tr>