 1438, 1474, 1570], \"page_id\": 74}], \"content\": \"Note\\u2014Annual balance sheets for fiscal years 1934 through 1940 appeared in the 1940 \\\"Annual Report of the Secretary of the Treasury\\\" and those for succeeding years appeared in subsequent reports through 1980. Quarterly balance sheets beginning with December 31, 1938, have been published in the \\\"Treasury Bulletin.\\\" Data from inception to September 30, 1978, may be found on the statements published in the January 1979 \\\"Treasury Bulletin.\\\"\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"footnote\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1472, 101, 1504, 127], \"page_id\": 75}], \"content\": \"68\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [548, 198, 1086, 231], \"page_id\": 75}], \"content\": \"TABLE TF-6A\\u2014Highway Trust Fund\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 250, 798, 372], \"page_id\": 75}], \"content\": \"The following information is released according to the provisions of the Byrd Amendment [codified at 26 United States Code 9503(d)] and represents estimates concerning the Highway Trust Fund at the close of the next fiscal year.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [832, 248, 1494, 368], \"page_id\": 75}], \"content\": \"The 48-month revenue estimates for the highway and mass transit accounts, respectively, include the latest estimates received from Treasury's Office of Tax Analysis for excise taxes, net of refunds.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [692, 486, 942, 521], \"page_id\": 75}], \"content\": \"Highway Account\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [690, 535, 945, 556], \"page_id\": 75}], \"content\": \"[In billions of dollars. Source: DOT]\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [151, 568, 1488